  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "図書室",
    "id": "43",
    "timezone": "3"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ふふ。賑やかだねぇ、ドタバタ喜劇も嫌いではないのだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「まぁ、私の流儀ではないのだが。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「今回は急を要する案件だったし、『図書室の怪人』としての活動はご無沙汰だったからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ブランクがあるぶん、拙い台本なのは勘弁してもらおうじゃないか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「……解説が必要かね、少年？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「構図は、単純明快なのだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「『帰宅部争奪戦』とやらの、前提条件を思いだしてほしい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「部員のおおい部活に、それに見合った金額の部費が与えられる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「そんな教師の告示が、事態の発端なのだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「部費を求め、各々の部活は新入部員の獲得に躍起になっている。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ここまでは、君も知ってのとおりだろう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「その状況を利用し、あの瀬川かえでくんが陰謀を巡らせた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「『陰謀』などと表現するのも烏滸がましい、かわいらしいほど浅はかな計略だったのだがね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「彼女はどうも、あの『女王陛下』の腰巾着らしい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「『女王陛下』こと円城寺れいかくんは、茶道部に所属している」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ここまで言えば、わかるかね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「瀬川くんが合唱部の桐島くんを利用して、『豪華景品』を用意させ、『抽選会』を開催した」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「その『抽選会』で『豪華景品』目当てに訪れた入部希望者たちは、こぞって入部届に記名していたが……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「その入部届には、細工がしてあったのだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「そう。それは合唱部ではなく、茶道部への入部届だったというわけだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「『豪華景品』目当ての入部希望者たちは、よく入部届を見もせずに記名したようだが……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「そこには、入部先の部活名が記されていなかったのだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「あとでその入部届を回収し、『茶道部』と記す。それだけで大量の新入部員を、あくまで書類上だが……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「茶道部が、獲得することになる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「瀬川くんは、それで茶道部に所属している『女王陛下』に褒めてもらおうとしたのさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「たいした、忠犬ぶりじゃないか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「あの『女王陛下』は、どうやら『帰宅部争奪戦』に積極的に関わり、文化系の部活動に荷担し……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「おおくの新入部員を、集めようとしているようだからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「その意を汲んで、瀬川くんが動いたのだよ。あくまで、独断でね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「『女王陛下』が事実、そんなことを望んでいるかどうかは問題ではない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「すくなくとも瀬川くんは、『そのため』に全力を尽くしたのだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「まぁ、瀬川くんはずいぶん欲深いようだからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「部活名を自由に書き換えられる、大量の入部届という……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「『帰宅部争奪戦』において有用に活かせる手札を、得たかったのかもしれないが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「『それ』があれば、どんなふうにも活用できる。すべての部活に対して、おおきな優位性を得る。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「強大な武器になる、瀬川くんは『それ』を求めたのだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ともあれ瀬川くんは知己である桐島くんを利用して、大量の新入部員を獲得するための行動にでた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「その行動は、陰謀は、実を結ぼうとしていたようだがね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「申し訳ないが、私たちが介入し……。邪魔させてもらったよ、思う存分に」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「もう君咲学院はかつてのように、他人によって生きる道を制限され、束縛される牢獄ではない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「誰もが自由に、青春を謳歌できる楽園になったのだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「部活という、青春において大事な要素を、勝手に決められ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「書き換えられる、そんな事態は看過できない。旧い友人に、助力を請われたのもあるがね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「らしくない真似をしたよ、すこし反省している。私も退屈していたのかねぇ、優雅な楽隠居……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「傍観者として、のんびり余生を過ごすつもりだったのだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ともあれ、茶道部というのも問題だったね。これは私の推測だがね、あの『女王陛下』の目的はきっと……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「いいや。まだ、すべては語るまい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「すべての解答をただ『ぽん』と与えられ、オチまで懇切丁寧に解説されて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「そんな読書では、ちっとも楽しくない。推測し、考えながら読み進めたまえ、少年」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「これは、君の物語なのだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「まぁいい、今回は瀬川くんが個人的に暴走しただけだが……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「部下の失態を、勝手な振る舞いを見てあの『女王陛下』が動かないわけがない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「次は、彼女がでてくるよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「君がどう対応するか、見物だねぇ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「君の敬愛する、あの偉大でかわいい生徒会長が死力を尽くして立ち向かい、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ようやく打ち倒した大物との直接対決だ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「かつて私たちを打ちのめした、あの『女王陛下』が始めた『帰宅部争奪戦』なる馬鹿騒ぎに……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「私たちの愛した『あの子』の弟である君が立ち向かう、という構図も趣深い」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「楽しませてもらうよ、ううん期待している。君の物語を、心の底からね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「今度こそ過たぬように、見ていられなくなったら口ぐらいだすけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「君は『彼女』のように独りで抱えこまずに、何かあったら私たちを頼りたまえよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「私たちとは時代がちがう、現在の君咲学院には悲劇より喜劇が相応しい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「君の周りには仲間がいて、あったかい友情や絆が充ち満ちている。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「それを、どうか忘れないでほしい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「……おっと、もう完全下校時刻もとっくに過ぎているね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「図書室の鍵を閉めたいので、君はもう帰りたまえ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「本の整理を手伝ってもらって、悪かったね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「今日は『がら』にもなく忙しくしてしまったので、図書委員会の仕事が滞っていたのだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
